# Harness engineering

This repo follows [OpenAI harness engineering](https://openai.com/index/harness-engineering/) (see [docs/harness-engineering.md](../../docs/harness-engineering.md)).

## Rules for agents

1. **AGENTS.md is a map** — do not bloat it; add detail under `docs/`.
2. **System of record = git** — encode decisions in `docs/`, code, or `.cursor/rules/`, not chat-only.
3. **Progressive disclosure** — start at [docs/index.md](../../docs/index.md), then open one topic doc.
4. **Mechanical invariants** — prefer tests + `lib/popup-safety.sh` + validation over prose alone.
5. **Missing capability** — add doc/test/guardrail; don't only retry prompts.
6. **Safety first** — [docs/SAFETY.md](../../docs/SAFETY.md) overrides velocity.

